            "description": "If all the models in a unit of 5 or more models with this trait are in base to base contact with each other, the unit is considered to be In Formation. While In Formation, the unit gains the Big Target trait, the Intimidating trait, and a -1 bonus to its Melee Save tests. When the unit includes a Non-Commissioned Officer, it also gains a -1 bonus to its Resolve tests.",
